#: block.py:126
msgid "Display Name"
msgstr "Vertoon Naam"

#: block.py:128
msgid ""
"The display name for this component. Analytics reports may also use the "
"display name to identify this component."
msgstr ""
"Die vertoonnaam vir hierdie komponent. Analytics-verslae kan ook die "
"vertoonnaam gebruik om hierdie komponent te identifiseer."

#: block.py:136
msgid "LTI ID"
msgstr "LTI ID"

#: block.py:139
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Enter the LTI ID for the external LTI provider.  This value must be the same"
" LTI ID that you entered in the LTI Passports setting on the Advanced "
"Settings page.{break_tag}See {docs_anchor_open}the edX LTI "
"documentation{anchor_close} for more details on this setting."
msgstr ""
"Voer die LTI-ID vir die eksterne LTI-verskaffer in. Hierdie waarde moet "
"dieselfde LTI ID wees wat jy in die LTI Paspoorte-instelling op die "
"Gevorderde Instellings-bladsy ingevoer het. {break_tag} Sien "
"{docs_anchor_open} die edX LTI-dokumentasie {anchor_close} vir meer "
"besonderhede oor hierdie instelling."

#: block.py:155
msgid "LTI URL"
msgstr "LTI URL"

#: block.py:158
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Enter the URL of the external tool that this component launches. This "
"setting is only used when Hide External Tool is set to False.{break_tag}See "
"{docs_anchor_open}the edX LTI documentation{anchor_close} for more details "
"on this setting."
msgstr ""
"Voer die URL van die eksterne nutsding in wat hierdie komponent begin. "
"Hierdie instelling word slegs gebruik wanneer Versteek eksterne hulpmiddel "
"op Onwaar gestel is. {break_tag} Sien {docs_anchor_open} die edX LTI-"
"dokumentasie {anchor_close} vir meer besonderhede oor hierdie instelling."

#: block.py:173
msgid "Custom Parameters"
msgstr "Pasgemaakte parameters"

#: block.py:176
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Add the key/value pair for any custom parameters, such as the page your "
"e-book should open to or the background color for this "
"component.{break_tag}See {docs_anchor_open}the edX LTI "
"documentation{anchor_close} for more details on this setting."
msgstr ""
"Voeg die sleutel/waarde-paar by vir enige pasgemaakte parameters, soos die "
"bladsy waarop jou e-boek moet oopmaak of die agtergrondkleur vir hierdie "
"komponent. {break_tag} Sien {docs_anchor_open} die edX LTI-dokumentasie "
"{anchor_close} vir meer besonderhede oor hierdie instelling."

#: block.py:190
msgid "Open in New Page"
msgstr "Maak oop in nuwe bladsy"

#: block.py:192
msgid ""
"Select True if you want students to click a link that opens the LTI tool in "
"a new window. Select False if you want the LTI content to open in an IFrame "
"in the current page. This setting is only used when Hide External Tool is "
"set to False.  "
msgstr ""
"Kies Waar as jy wil hê studente moet 'n skakel klik wat die LTI-nutsding in "
"'n nuwe venster oopmaak. Kies Onwaar as jy wil hê dat die LTI-inhoud in 'n "
"IFrame op die huidige bladsy moet oopmaak. Hierdie instelling word slegs "
"gebruik wanneer Versteek eksterne hulpmiddel op Onwaar gestel is.  "

#: block.py:201
msgid "Scored"
msgstr "Aangeteken"

#: block.py:202
msgid ""
"Select True if this component will receive a numerical score from the "
"external LTI system."
msgstr ""
"Kies Waar as hierdie komponent 'n numeriese telling van die eksterne LTI-"
"stelsel sal ontvang."

#: block.py:208
msgid "Weight"
msgstr "Gewig"

#: block.py:210
msgid ""
"Enter the number of points possible for this component.  The default value "
"is 1.0.  This setting is only used when Scored is set to True."
msgstr ""
"Voer die aantal punte moontlik vir hierdie komponent in. Die verstekwaarde "
"is 1.0. Hierdie instelling word slegs gebruik wanneer Puntetelling op Waar "
"gestel is."

#: block.py:220
msgid ""
"The score kept in the xblock KVS -- duplicate of the published score in "
"django DB"
msgstr ""
"Die telling gehou in die xblok KVS -- duplikaat van die gepubliseerde "
"telling in django DB"

#: block.py:225
msgid "Comment as returned from grader, LTI2.0 spec"
msgstr "Kommentaar soos teruggestuur van gradeerder, LTI2.0-spesifikasie"

#: block.py:228
msgid "Hide External Tool"
msgstr "Versteek eksterne hulpmiddel"

#: block.py:230
msgid ""
"Select True if you want to use this component as a placeholder for syncing "
"with an external grading  system rather than launch an external tool.  This "
"setting hides the Launch button and any IFrames for this component."
msgstr ""
"Kies Waar as jy hierdie komponent as 'n plekhouer wil gebruik vir "
"sinkronisering met 'n eksterne graderingstelsel eerder as om 'n eksterne "
"nutsding te begin. Hierdie instelling versteek die Begin-knoppie en enige "
"IFrame vir hierdie komponent."

#: block.py:242
msgid "Request user's username"
msgstr "Versoek gebruiker se gebruikersnaam"

#. Translators: This is used to request the user's username for a third party
#. service.
#: block.py:244
msgid "Select True to request the user's username."
msgstr "Kies Waar om die gebruiker se gebruikersnaam aan te vra."

#: block.py:250
msgid "Request user's email"
msgstr "Versoek gebruiker se e-pos"

#. Translators: This is used to request the user's email for a third party
#. service.
#: block.py:252
msgid "Select True to request the user's email address."
msgstr "Kies Waar om die gebruiker se e-posadres aan te vra."

#: block.py:258
msgid "LTI Application Information"
msgstr "LTI Aansoek inligting"

#: block.py:260
msgid ""
"Enter a description of the third party application. If requesting username "
"and/or email, use this text box to inform users why their username and/or "
"email will be forwarded to a third party application."
msgstr ""
"Voer 'n beskrywing van die derdeparty-toepassing in. As u 'n gebruikersnaam "
"en/of e-pos versoek, gebruik hierdie tekskassie om gebruikers in te lig "
"waarom hul gebruikersnaam en/of e-pos na 'n derdeparty-toepassing aangestuur"
" sal word."

#: block.py:268
msgid "Button Text"
msgstr "Knoppie teks"

#: block.py:269
msgid ""
"Enter the text on the button used to launch the third party application."
msgstr ""
"Voer die teks in op die knoppie wat gebruik word om die derdeparty-"
"toepassing te begin."

#: block.py:275
msgid "Accept grades past deadline"
msgstr "Aanvaar grade verby sperdatum"

#: block.py:276
msgid ""
"Select True to allow third party systems to post grades past the deadline."
msgstr ""
"Kies Waar om derdepartystelsels toe te laat om grade verby die sperdatum te "
"plaas."

#: block.py:443
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Could not parse custom parameter: {custom_parameter}. Should be \"x=y\" "
"string."
msgstr ""
"Kon nie gepasmaakte parameter ontleed nie: {custom_parameter} . Moet "
"\"x=y\"-string wees."

#: block.py:989
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Could not parse LTI passport: {lti_passport}. Should be \"id:key:secret\" "
"string."
msgstr ""
"Kon nie LTI-paspoort ontleed nie: {lti_passport} . Moet "
"\"id:key:secret\"-string wees."

#. Translators:  "External resource" means that this learning module is hosted
#. on a platform external to the edX LMS
#: templates/lti.html:6
msgid "External resource"
msgstr "Eksterne hulpbron"

#. Translators: "points" is the student's achieved score on this LTI unit, and
#. "total_points" is the maximum number of points achievable.
#: templates/lti.html:13
msgid "points"
msgstr "punte"

#: templates/lti.html:14
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{points} / {total_points} points"
msgstr "{points} / {total_points} punte"

#. Translators: "total_points" is the maximum number of points achievable on
#. this LTI unit
#: templates/lti.html:18
msgid "total_points"
msgstr "totaal_punte"

#: templates/lti.html:40
msgid "View resource in a new window"
msgstr "Bekyk hulpbron in &#39;n nuwe venster"

#: templates/lti.html:60
msgid ""
"Please provide launch_url. Click \"Edit\", and fill in the required fields."
msgstr ""
"Verskaf asseblief launch_url. Klik op &quot;Wysig&quot; en vul die vereiste "
"velde in."

#: templates/lti_form.html:28
msgid "Press to Launch"
msgstr "Druk om te begin"
